review_comments.body:
**Blocking: this fails CI.** `Go Linter` reports `claudemodel.go:75:28: QF1001: could apply De Morgan's law (staticcheck)` on the `!(...)` conjunction.

An early return is both lint-clean and easier to read than the De Morgan form:

```go
// Opus dropped custom sampling at 4.7, ahead of the 5 generation.
if model.Family == "opus" && model.Major == 4 && model.Minor >= 7 {
	return false
}
return model.Major < 5
```
